  "description": "🎉 NEW v2.0: Smart Auto-Registration! A revolutionary library that brings zero-configuration dependency injection to .NET. Now automatically discovers and registers dependencies on-demand - no manual registration needed! Use [Injectable] attributes with InjectBase for the cleanest DI experience possible. Eliminates both constructor injection boilerplate AND manual service registration.",
